    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70ef0d4fba52fdea",
      "translationZh": "嗨 r/LocalLLaMA。我在香港的 Blockway 小团队工作（披露：这是我们的模型）。今天我们发布了 Agens Volundr 32B Preview，这是首个基于我们自研混合架构的模型。我们在有限算力下进行训练，模型并不完美，我们宁愿提前告知它的不足之处。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d373eb88d6ee7a6",
      "translationZh": "我们的客户在自己的机器上运行模型。在长上下文场景中，决定能否容纳的是 KV 缓存，而不是模型权重。因此我们设计了一种模型，使大多数层不保留 KV 缓存。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7a1ea88774e2c52",
      "translationZh": "架构（72 层，稠密约 32 B，每层在每个标记上运行）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "232c7d1dac1d6dd2",
      "translationZh": "54 层 KDA（Kimi Delta Attention）：线性注意力，使用固定大小的循环状态，无 KV 缓存",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37b66c8b69f20b6f",
      "translationZh": "1 个全注意力层（第 72 层）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e9a5fc6ff4f0c4f",
      "translationZh": "Engram：一种存储在主机 RAM 中的哈希 n-gram 记忆，附着在 72 层中的第 2 层",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3adeab8fa8c27bd2",
      "translationZh": "mHC：4 条残差流，而不是 1 条",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cab9e1c03d757f3",
      "translationZh": "因此，只有 72 层中的 18 层保留 KV 缓存。上下文窗口：262K。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f75e76c36d7849f2",
      "translationZh": "速度（单用户，我们的 sglang 构建）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    }
  ],
